#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5209
msgid ""
"The instance carries the ports; a new one gets the next free ports on its"
" node, and its Saved Games directory is created there. Nothing is "
"started: the server is created and comes up when somebody starts it or "
"the scheduler does."
msgstr ""
"端口属于实例；新实例会获得其节点上的下一个空闲端口，并在该节点创建其 Saved Games "
"目录。不会启动任何内容：服务器创建后，需有人启动或由计划任务启动。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:5215
